{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011ChPuqFGn9DDKC8pV1nRfX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_017nRbkcVkmBYfofDFERvPRE","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /work; git -c core.excludesFile=/dev/null status --porcelain --untracked-files=all | grep -v \"^ M\\|internal/.*_test.go\\|slots.go\\|controls.go\"\ncat > .ard/415/worker-engineer.md <<'EOF'\n---\nrole: engineer\nstatus: done\nattempt: 1\n---\nAdds the `p`, `+` and `-` keys to the serve command center. `p` toggles the local pause file, and `+`/`-` set a bounded runtime slot override that a config reload no longer wipes. It stays until `max_pods` on main changes.\n\n## Changes\n- `internal/servecmd/slots.go` (new): in-memory override with a mutex, bounds `1..min(2×config,16)`, cleared when config `max_pods` differs from the value it was set against; logs `pool.max_override`.\n- `internal/servecmd/controls.go` (new): implements the UI controls. Pause creates the file (idempotent), unpause removes it and wakes the selected loops, and refuses a directory. Slot keys call `SetMax`, which never revokes held slots, so lowering drains.\n- `internal/servecmd/serve.go`, `ui.go`, `snapshot.go`: the reload hook uses the override-aware cap, and controls are passed to the UI.\n- `internal/snapshot/snapshot.go`: `PoolView.ConfigMax` and `Override`, via an optional `Sources.Override`.\n- `internal/ui`: `Controls` interface, `Model.WithControls` (nil keeps the keys inert, so `New` is unchanged), toast with expiry, confirm for unpause, `PAUSED (file)` and `max_pods N (config M)` and `draining` in the header, help text including the dry-run note. Label, config and local-config pauses are never touched; a toast says how to lift them.\n- `docs/proposal.md`: Concurrency, Kill switch and Keys text. Golden files updated for the new footer.\n\n## Testing\n`make lint test` passes. New tests: `servecmd/slots_test.go` (bounds, survives reloads, cleared on config change, config file untouched), `servecmd/controls_test.go` (pause/unpause, directory refusal, pool not ready), `ui/controls_test.go` (keys, confirm, other sources, toast expiry, nil controls, header, help).\n\n## Open issues\n- The plan's `ui.New` signature change was replaced by `WithControls`, which is smaller.\n- The plan's pool test and fake-clock tests were not added. The override has no clock, and `SetMax` never revoking slots is existing pool behaviour.\n- `go test -race ./internal/servecmd` reports a race in the existing `TestRunWithUI` (its `stopped` variable). It is not part of this change, and `make test` does not use `-race`.\nEOF"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1275,"cache_read_input_tokens":50890,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1275},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"cda789f5-bc10-4a50-acbb-61d367c90867","uuid":"ef1e3161-e19e-4f1d-b22c-ead530637ddf","timestamp":"2026-11-25T15:50:22.573Z","request_id":"req_011ChPuqF7McGtmdAFLk5vb6"}
